# CBA Customer Intelligence

Pipeline: collect -> process -> categorise -> analyse -> recommend -> UI. Package `src/ci/`, config in `config/`, prompts in `prompts/`, skill specs in `skills/`.
Start by reading `AGENTS.md` and `docs/context/*` (chat history, requirements, open items).

Commands: `make demo`, `make test`, `make eval`, `python -m ci <stage>`.

Rules:
- Statistics are computed in code, never by an LLM.
- Stages exchange CSV files only (see `docs/data-contract.md`).
- Never read or print `.env`; never commit raw data or credentials.
- No live side effects (credentialed collectors, Jira push) without explicit user approval; Jira stays dry-run by default.
- Report segment, period and n with any result; results are directional.
